Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### PASSENGER: REJECT OFFER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ride-requests/{{rideRequestId}}/offers/{{offerId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### DRIVER: CANCEL OFFER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ride-requests/{{rideRequestId}}/offers/{{offerId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

